{"id":"f5a97ab309ebc2f7","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-ordexp.md","title":"Ordinal Exponentiation","display":"df-ordexp — Ordinal Exponentiation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ordexp","aliases":["58-df-ordexp"],"display":"df-ordexp — Ordinal Exponentiation","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-ordmul.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ordexp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ordexp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordexp — Ordinal Exponentiation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e510d30d624c8a51\" href=\"?note=e510d30d624c8a51\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-ordmul.md\">../batch20/58-df-ordmul.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> is the proper class of ordinals; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot:\\mathrm{Ord}^2\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\cdot:\\mathrm{Ord}^2\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e510d30d624c8a51\" href=\"?note=e510d30d624c8a51\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-ordmul.md\">../batch20/58-df-ordmul.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrdExp}:\\mathrm{Ord}^2\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\operatorname{OrdExp}:\\mathrm{Ord}^2\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> is a class operation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordexp} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\operatorname{OrdExp}(\\alpha,0)\\coloneqq1)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordexp} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\operatorname{OrdExp}(\\alpha,0)\\coloneqq1)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordexp\\text{-}successor} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\operatorname{OrdExp}(\\alpha,\\beta+1)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{OrdExp}(\\alpha,\\beta)\\cdot\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordexp\\text{-}successor} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\operatorname{OrdExp}(\\alpha,\\beta+1)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{OrdExp}(\\alpha,\\beta)\\cdot\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordexp\\text{-}limit} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\forall\\alpha,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\operatorname{OrdExp}(\\alpha,\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}\\operatorname{OrdExp}(\\alpha,\\xi))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordexp\\text{-}limit} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\forall\\alpha,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\operatorname{OrdExp}(\\alpha,\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}\\operatorname{OrdExp}(\\alpha,\\xi))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-ordmul.md","status":"resolved","id":"e510d30d624c8a51","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-ordmul.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord}$ is the proper class of ordinals; $\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location"